  <section class="site-section home-statement">
    <div class="canadiana-shell">
      <div class="home-statement-layout">
        <article class="home-statement-card">
          <h2 class="section-title">Statement on Problematic Content and Descriptions in Canadiana</h2>
          <p class="section-lede">
            The Canadiana Collections contain content created over five centuries that tell an incomplete, oftentimes distorted and, sometimes harmful, story of Canada.
            The content, metadata, and resource descriptions in the Canadiana Collections contain language that reflects the biases, norms, and perspectives of the time
            in which they were created. This includes harmful and offensive wording, cultural references, and stereotypes.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>support and actively participate in efforts to update and change international standards for descriptions to ensure that descriptions are inclusive, respectful, and do not cause harm</li>
            <li>replace inappropriate language in metadata and resource descriptions introduced during legacy cataloguing practices</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            This is an ongoing process. If you see records with inappropriate language or content that you think CRKN should review.
          </p>
          <a class="home-statement-cta" href="https://www.crkn-rcdr.ca/sites/crkn/files/2021-09/Final%20-%20Review%20Request%20Process%20for%20the%20Canadiana%20Collection%20-%20EN.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Review submission form
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </a>
        </article>
        <div class="home-statement-media">
          <img src="<%= asset_path('statement.png') %>" alt="Person reviewing archival documents at a worktable" loading="lazy">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%= render(MembersComponent.new) %>
